      "retention": "Until the owner removes it; both secrets are sealed under the key of the tenant (INT-1578, SEC-003). An event identifier is kept for seven days (INT-1577).",
      "erasure": {
        "point": "its removal by the owner"
      },
      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "scope": "platform",
      "realisation": "target"
    },
    {
