      "description": "An accepted invocation of a tenant operation, so a repeat with the same key answers with its result (OPR-1544). Realised by a row of tbl-idempotency: the invoker and the operation form its scope and the key is its key, the hash of the inputs is its request hash, and it is kept seven days (D-7701, SCH-2702). Erasing the invoker does not remove its rows yet."
    },
