    },
    {
      "id": "q-sign-in-with-password-burst",
      "description": "Anonymous calls of sign-in-with-password from one source address in one minute: the burst limit that sits beside the fifteen-minute budget of q-sign-in-with-password (IDN-250, D-700, D-7800). The two measure different things, so both are stated.",
      "scope": "source-address",
